# Every atomic write in this codebase (trade_memory.py, dip_calibration_engine.py,
# run_everything.py's _atomic_write_json/_export_omlx_metrics_once, resource_monitor.py)
# goes through a <file>.tmp intermediate before os.replace() — a crash or
# kill mid-write can leave one behind. None of them should ever be tracked.
*.tmp
